Open [Machine Setup — macOS Apple Silicon](./machine-setup-guide/index.mdx), then [First Local Run](./first-local-run.mdx). Detailed integrations remain in Architecture, Platform & SDKs, Push Notifications & Deep Linking, CI/CD, Testing & Quality, Observability, GenAI & Tools, and App Stores & Distribution.

